      "title": "What changed in tenant deposit laws this year",
      "question": "Summarize this year's changes to our state's tenant deposit laws for our staff, with a source for every point.",
      "summary": "State B now gives landlords 21 days to return a deposit, with an itemized list for anything kept, for leases signed after 1 March 2027. State A now asks for 60 days of written notice before a rent increase above 5 percent, from 1 January 2027.",
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "text": "In State B, a landlord must return a security deposit within 21 days after a tenant moves out.",
          "citations": [
            {
              "source": "SRC-TENANT-02",
              "quote": "A landlord must return a security deposit within 21 days after a tenant moves out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "text": "Anything the landlord keeps needs an itemized list of deductions. The rule covers leases signed after 1 March 2027.",
          "citations": [
            {
              "source": "SRC-TENANT-02",
              "quote": "Any amount withheld must come with an itemized list of deductions."
            },
            {
              "source": "SRC-TENANT-02",
              "quote": "The bill applies to leases signed after 1 March 2027."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "text": "In State A, tenants get 60 days of written notice before a rent increase above 5 percent, starting 1 January 2027.",
          "citations": [
            {
              "source": "SRC-TENANT-01",
              "quote": "Section 2 requires a landlord to give tenants 60 days of written notice before any rent increase above 5 percent."
            },
            {
              "source": "SRC-TENANT-01",
              "quote": "Section 3 makes the act take effect on 1 January 2027."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "text": "City C's housing office explains new tenant laws each week, as general information.",
          "citations": [
            {
